  "description": "A series about a hyper-realistic fantasy game! \n\n*\"Sargent Ha, you crazy bastard. You shot another full round of bullseyes?\"* \n\nThe sharpshooter Ha Lee-Ha simply wanted to be a part of the army forever. However, due to an unfortunate accident, he became paraplegic and was tossed back into society. The revolutionary VR game \\[Middle Earth\\] presented a new life to him. Money obtained in \\[Middle Earth\\] has real-world value! Yet, he ruined his chance by selecting the lowest-tier character! \n\n*\"I'm not like the others. This is all I have.\"* \n\nBlack gunpowder, iron balls, and ramrods... I'll show you all what a real 'musketeer' is!",
